          daňovej licencie v súlade s § 46b ods. 5 a § 52zk", 20. 12. 2018,
          which prints the vzor's own captions;
        * 2024-2025 from the spine's DPPOv25 poučenie citations.

      2013-2015 and 2020-2022 are bare in that block on purpose. The first
      version of this file extrapolated the v24/v25 spine backwards and got
      r820 and r900 wrong; the usmernenie disagreed. Do not infer a row in
      this block from another vzor.
